  ('weapons-possession', 'IL', '720 ILCS 5/24-1', 'Unlawful Use of Weapons', 'Class A Misdemeanor to Class 4 Felony depending on circumstances', NULL, '1 year (misdemeanor); 3 years (Class 4 felony)', '$25,000', '{"Sold, manufactured, transferred, purchased, possessed, or carried a weapon","In circumstances prohibited by law (concealed without license, in vehicle without proper storage, switchblade, tear gas, etc.)"}', NULL, '{"Aggravated UUW (720 ILCS 5/24-1.6): Class 4 to Class 1 Felony for prior felony or possessing while masked"}', 'Illinois requires a FOID card for all firearm possession. Carrying without FOID or CCLC triggers UUW.'),
