  ('embezzlement', 'IL', '720 ILCS 5/16-1(a)(2)', 'Theft by Lawful Possession (Embezzlement)', 'Class A Misdemeanor (under $500); Class 3 to Class 1 Felony (based on value)', NULL, '1 year (misdemeanor); up to 15 years (Class 1 felony)', '$25,000', '{"Obtained lawful possession of property","Converted that property to personal use without authorization","With intent to permanently deprive the owner"}', NULL, '{}', 'Illinois does not have a separate embezzlement statute. Covered under general theft statute 720 ILCS 5/16-1 as ''theft by lawful possession''.'),
